<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1332898058"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1799663028"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="UNSTOPPABLE"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="RAISE A SUILEN"/><amll:meta key="album" value="R·I·O·T"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:34.513"><div begin="00:00.957" end="03:34.833"><p begin="00:00.957" end="00:03.968" itunes:key="L16345">答えは そう…inside of me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">答案 是的 就在我心中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kyo ku ： fu ji ta ju n hi ra ( Elements Garden)</span></p><p begin="00:04.241" end="00:07.105" itunes:key="L16346">But…But…だけど "UNSTOPPABLE"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可是 可是 已无法停息</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">But but da ke do unstoppable</span></p><p begin="00:07.115" end="00:12.226" itunes:key="L16347">I・MY・満たして欲しいと せがみだす<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我 我想得到满足</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I my mi ta shi te ho shi i to</span></p><p begin="00:12.236" end="00:15.295" itunes:key="L16348">答えは もう…inside of me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">答案 已经 就在我心中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ta e ha mo u inside of me</span></p><p begin="00:15.565" end="00:18.379" itunes:key="L16349">But…But…だけど "UNSTOPPABLE"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可是 可是 已无法停息</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">But but da ke do unstoppable</span></p><p begin="00:18.389" end="00:23.337" itunes:key="L16350">I・MY・満たして欲しいと せがみだす<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我 我想得到满足</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I my mi ta shi te ho shi i to</span></p><p begin="00:23.347" end="00:25.546" itunes:key="L16351">SOMEBODY HELP<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">谁来帮帮我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Somebody help</span></p><p begin="00:37.272" end="00:42.876" itunes:key="L16352">喉が渇いて仕方ないようで 生まれた虚無感<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喉咙干渴束手无策</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">no do ga ka wa i te shi ka ta na i yo u de</span></p><p begin="00:42.886" end="00:48.048" itunes:key="L16353">日々を過剰に期待し過ぎ…拗ねた背中<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对日常抱有过剩的期待</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi bi wo ka jo u ni ki ta i shi su gi</span></p><p begin="00:48.058" end="00:49.195" itunes:key="L16354">(Hurry up)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(抓紧时间)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( hurry up)</span></p><p begin="00:49.305" end="00:51.072" itunes:key="L16355">「Don't let me down.」といつも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“别让我失望”无论何时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">『 don't let me down』 to i tsu mo</span></p><p begin="00:50.882" end="00:52.051" itunes:key="L16356">(Hurry up)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(抓紧时间)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( hurry up)</span></p><p begin="00:52.061" end="00:57.906" itunes:key="L16357">自分を追い詰めて 口を塞ぎ呼吸困難<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总把自己逼入绝境</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ji bu n wo o i tsu me te</span></p><p begin="00:58.037" end="01:00.912" itunes:key="L16358">Be caught in a trap<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被陷阱所困</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Be caught in a trap</span></p><p begin="01:02.161" end="01:04.464" itunes:key="L16359">ウザったいとジレったいが甘えて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">撒娇说太吵闹太焦急</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u za 't ta i to ji re 't ta i ga a ma e te</span></p><p begin="01:04.474" end="01:07.472" itunes:key="L16360">Just 承認欲求 every day 止まらない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只需要承认欲求 每一天都无法停息</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Just sho u ni n yo 'k kyu u every day to ma ra na i</span></p><p begin="01:07.482" end="01:10.418" itunes:key="L16361">僕と僕は共犯者さ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我和我就是共犯</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku to bo ku ha kyo u ha n sha sa</span></p><p begin="01:10.428" end="01:13.440" itunes:key="L16362">偽物と踊れ踊れ (Lullaby)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">和虚假一同起舞吧(摇篮曲)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ni se mo no to o do re o do re ( lullaby)</span></p><p begin="01:13.450" end="01:16.097" itunes:key="L16363">迷いと不安が舌を出して<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">迷茫与不安在暗中嘲笑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma yo i to fu a n ga shi ta wo da shi te</span></p><p begin="01:16.107" end="01:18.774" itunes:key="L16364">コチラを指さし嘲る<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">指着这边嘲笑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko chi ra wo yu bi sa shi a za ke ru</span></p><p begin="01:18.784" end="01:21.738" itunes:key="L16365">Are you enjoying? Are you excited?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你享受吗?</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Are you enjoying?</span></p><p begin="01:21.748" end="01:23.662" itunes:key="L16366">…Yes? そう見えるの？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Yes?看起来像这样吗?</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Yes? so u mi e ru no ?</span></p><p begin="01:23.672" end="01:27.801" itunes:key="L16367">じゃあ…それでいい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那就够了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ja a so re de i i</span></p><p begin="01:36.580" end="01:42.170" itunes:key="L16368">何不自由ないだけで 底はカラッポだったと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有任何不自由</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ni fu ji yu u na i da ke de</span></p><p begin="01:42.180" end="01:47.291" itunes:key="L16369">吐き散らかした 夢や希望を静かに見つめ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">说自己腹中空空</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ki chi ra ka shi ta</span></p><p begin="01:47.301" end="01:48.583" itunes:key="L16370">(Let me see)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(让我看看)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( let me see)</span></p><p begin="01:48.593" end="01:50.367" itunes:key="L16371">「Do you agree?」…仕方ない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“你同意吗？”没办法</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">『 do you agree?』 shi ka ta na i</span></p><p begin="01:50.177" end="01:51.321" itunes:key="L16372">(Let me see)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(让我看看)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( let me see)</span></p><p begin="01:51.331" end="01:57.156" itunes:key="L16373">問いかけに ただ頷くよう目を瞑れば<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">面对疑问</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to i ka ke ni</span></p><p begin="01:57.366" end="02:00.372" itunes:key="L16374">I get lost in a maze<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">否则我会迷失在迷宫中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I get lost in a maze</span></p><p begin="02:27.682" end="02:30.778" itunes:key="L16375">答えは そう…inside of me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">答案 是的 就在我心中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ta e ha so u inside of me</span></p><p begin="02:31.124" end="02:33.849" itunes:key="L16376">But…But…だけど "UNSTOPPABLE"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可是 可是 已无法停息</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">But but da ke do unstoppable</span></p><p begin="02:33.930" end="02:38.995" itunes:key="L16377">I・MY・満たして欲しいと せがみだす<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我 我想得到满足</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I my mi ta shi te ho shi i to</span></p><p begin="02:39.005" end="02:42.133" itunes:key="L16378">答えは もう…inside of me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">答案 已经 就在我心中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ta e ha mo u inside of me</span></p><p begin="02:42.424" end="02:45.155" itunes:key="L16379">But…But…だけど "UNSTOPPABLE"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可是 可是 已无法停息</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">But but da ke do unstoppable</span></p><p begin="02:45.165" end="02:50.041" itunes:key="L16380">I・MY・満たして欲しいと せがみだす<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我 我想得到满足</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I my mi ta shi te ho shi i to</span></p><p begin="02:50.151" end="02:52.385" itunes:key="L16381">SOMEBODY HELP<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">谁来帮帮我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Somebody help</span></p><p begin="02:55.052" end="02:57.381" itunes:key="L16382">ウザったいとジレったいは無視して<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感觉吵闹</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u za 't ta i to</span></p><p begin="02:57.391" end="03:00.357" itunes:key="L16383">Just 承認欲求 every day 捨て去る<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只需要承认欲求 抛开每一天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Just sho u ni n yo 'k kyu u every day su te sa ru</span></p><p begin="03:00.367" end="03:03.320" itunes:key="L16384">僕と僕よ合わさって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将我与我自己结合</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku to bo ku yo a wa sa 't te</span></p><p begin="03:03.430" end="03:06.460" itunes:key="L16385">偽物は消えろ消えろ (Lullaby)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让虚假之物消失吧(摇篮曲)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ni se mo no ha ki e ro ki e ro ( lullaby)</span></p><p begin="03:06.470" end="03:09.163" itunes:key="L16386">迷いと不安が上を向いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">迷茫与不安抬头向上</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma yo i to fu a n ga u e wo mu i te</span></p><p begin="03:09.173" end="03:11.706" itunes:key="L16387">アチラヘ往こうと手招く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">招手呼唤要去往那里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a chi ra he yu ko u to te ma ne ku</span></p><p begin="03:11.716" end="03:14.698" itunes:key="L16388">Are you enjoying? Are you excited?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你享受吗?</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Are you enjoying?</span></p><p begin="03:14.708" end="03:16.641" itunes:key="L16389">…Yes? そう見えるの？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Yes?看起来像这样吗?</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Yes? so u mi e ru no ?</span></p><p begin="03:16.651" end="03:20.646" itunes:key="L16390">ねぇ…それがいい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 那样就好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne so re ga i i</span></p><p begin="03:28.779" end="03:34.833" itunes:key="L16391">DNA 疼く 赤裸々に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">DNA生出赤裸裸的疼痛</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">DNA u zu ku se ki ra ra ni</span></p></div></body></tt>